{
  "fixture": "Homebrew bc63375ac3a4d6debb1ceb441ae6e22854f0909a on macOS arm64/APFS with Git 2.56.0. Each invocation uses a separate fresh, populated local clone with an empty Graft cache and registry. Operating system caches were not flushed.",
